{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"\n\nAll done — here's what was changed:\n\n### CSS fix — `apps/storefront/styles/checkout.css`\n\nTwo changes inside the `@media (max-width: 600px)` block:\n\n1. **Removed `margin-bottom: -64px`** on `.checkout-summary` and replaced it with `margin-bottom: 16px`. The negative margin was pulling the sticky summary over the payment form content.\n2. **Added `padding-bottom: 80px`** on `.checkout-shell` so the payment form content (including the Place order CTA) sits above the fixed bottom bar instead of being hidden behind it.\n\nDesktop two-column grid and sticky summary behavior are untouched.\n\n### New test — `tests/e2e/test_checkout_mobile.py`\n\nThree assertions covering the mobile viewport:\n- Compact summary no longer uses negative margin\n- Shell has bottom padding to clear the fixed bar\n- Mobile bar is still `position: fixed` at `bottom: 0`\n\n### QA note — `docs/checkout_mobile_qa.md`\n\nDocuments the problem, root cause, fix, test coverage, and manual verification steps.\n\nAll 5 tests pass (2 existing + 3 new)."}}
